Title: F1-M06 — The Broken Dam (briefing)
Credit: Staalfront
Author: Staalfront narrative team
Draft date: 2026-10-17

FADE IN:

INT. FORWARD COMMAND POST - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

ENGINEER VENN
(serious)
The dam is failing. We have minutes before the lower road becomes a river.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

MIRA
(measured)
The enemy is still on the eastern bank. Our engineers and the local workers are trapped between them and the water.

CAPTAIN ELIAN
(firm)
Evacuate the workers, recover the engineers, and get every surviving unit to the marked high ground before the timer expires.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
